{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#card-zh","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 是为 DeepSeek Harness 提供交互式终端界面的 DSH profile bundle。它把单次任务退出改为围绕同一 agent 持续对话的 REPL，支持流式显示回复、在终端应答审批、用 slash 命令查看或切换模型与权限策略，并可列出和恢复已保存会话。适合在服务器或本机终端中持续使用 DSH；需要 Node.js 22 和 DSH profile，模型凭据沿用 DSH 配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:30-44","lib/runner.js:423-435","lib/runner.js:478-535"]}
{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#card-en","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-cli-interactive adds an interactive terminal for DeepSeek Harness. Its persistent REPL streams replies from one agent, handles approval prompts, and supports model changes and session resume. It requires Node.js 22 and a DSH profile.","source":"generated","evidence":["cordis.patch.yml:30-44","lib/runner.js:423-435","lib/runner.js:478-535"]}
