{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#feature-1","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 的功能「可持续对话」：在启动后进入 REPL，逐条读取输入并把消息交给当前 agent，回复内容按事件增量显示。可先提供一个初始任务，再继续交互。。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runner.js:538-563"]}
{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#feature-2","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 的功能「恢复已保存会话」：启动时传入 --resume <sessionId>，runner 使用 DSH sessions 服务恢复已有 agent 会话，随后在同一终端继续发送消息。。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runner.js:428-435"]}
{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#feature-3","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 的功能「终端审批与策略控制」：agent 发出审批请求时，终端展示工具名和原因并等待 y/n；/permission 可查看或切换 ask 与 never 策略。。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runner.js:402-425"]}
{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#feature-4","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 的功能「会话与模型命令」：slash 命令可列出最近保存的会话、显示当前会话和工作目录，也可切换下一轮使用的模型。。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runner.js:501-520"]}
{"unit_id":"studyinglx__dsh-cli#caveat-1","repo":"studyinglx/dsh-cli","commit":"a6c80b793b26bfdf5e8bdb067747d5649846eeb3","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-cli-interactive 使用 DSH_HOME（默认 ~/.dsh）保存 CLI 输入历史；会话由 sessions 服务 flush 持久化，退出时也会尝试保存。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/runner.js:361-369","lib/runner.js:584-594"]}
